OL,3,GNEWSAData centre protesters fear 'Bond
OL,4,Avillain levels' of damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters took to the streets near the
OL,7,Fsite of a planned new data centre to
OL,8,Fraise concerns about the environment
OL,9,Fand jobs, with one local politician
OL,10,Ffearing "Bond villain levels" of harm.
OL,12,FThe Silicone Sands scheme, planned for
OL,13,Fa site at the Blackpool Airport
OL,14,FEnterprise Zone, is being hailed by
OL,15,FBlackpool Council as a "game-changer"
OL,16,Ffor the area.
OL,18,FFriday's protest came as a separate
OL,19,Fpetition set up against the development
OL,20,Freached 1,441 signatures.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
